 ith leading Canadian authors. This package features Claire Cameron\, Emma 
 Knight and Anne Michaels. Each event includes a reading\, discussion\, aud
 ience Q&A\, book-signing and American sign language interpretation. By the
  Lake Book Club hosts six Tuesday-night events from February to December w
 ith top Canadian authors and Humber Polytechnics alumni. Each in-person ev
 ent features readings\, discussions\, Q&A\, book signings and ASL interpre
 tation\, while virtual sessions include live subtitles and audio access. C
 laire Cameron - September 15\, 2026 at 7 p.m. Emma Knight - October 6\, 20
 26 at 7 p.m. Anne Michaels - December 8\, 2026 at 7 p.m.
LOCATION:Assembly Hall\, 1 Colonel Samuel Smith Park Dr\, Etobicoke\, ON
